        item Change of assignment [233-001]
        item Formal study or research [233-005]
        item Illness/disability/death [233-006]
        item Layoff [233-007]
        item Discharge [233-002]
        item Personal reason [233-009]
        item Unknown [233-011]
        item Other [233-008]